                            <h4>Industrial Guidance</h4>
                            <p>Provided by Industry Coach (IC) who serves as mentor to support students in understanding work tasks and related topics.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="approach-card">
                            <i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher"></i>
                            <h4>Guided Learning</h4>
                            <p>Structured learning activities between lecturers and students as specified in the official Class Schedule.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="approach-card">
                            <i class="fas fa-book-reader"></i>
                            <h4>Independent Learning</h4>
                            <p>Takes place outside formal class schedule emphasizing cultivation of lifelong learning skills.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
